   "accessInformation": null,
   "licenseInfo": "<p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.0001pt; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-weight:bold;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Ciri-ciri aplikasi adalah seperti di bawah :</span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'></span></span></p><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold;'></span><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><br /></span></div><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style='font-family:inherit;'>1.<span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'>    </span></span></span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Pemetaan bacaan semasa paras sungai, paras laut dan taburan hujan daripada sensor-sensor JPS.</span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'></span></span></div><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:italic;'></span><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; margin-left:18pt; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-indent:-18pt; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style='font-family:inherit;'>2.<span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'>    </span></span></span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Pemetaan hotspot banjir yang dijana daripada data terbuka hotspot banjir negeri Pulau Pinang.<br /></span></span></p><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; margin-left:18pt; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-indent:-18pt; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style='font-family:inherit;'>3.<span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'>    </span></span></span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Carian pegawai, dan agensi bantuan. </span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'></span></span></p><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:italic;'></span><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; margin-left:18pt; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-indent:-18pt; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style='font-family:inherit;'>4.<span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'> </span></span></span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Carian lokasi pusat pemindahan banjir, badan-badan sukarela dan pembekal makanan secara interaktif mengikut radius yang diinputkan. </span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'></span></span></p><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:italic;'></span><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; margin-left:18pt; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-indent:-18pt; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style='font-family:inherit;'>5.<span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'>    </span></span></span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Carian lokasi pihak-pihak yang terlibat untuk kecemasan secara interaktif mengikut radius yang diinputkan. </span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'></span></span></p><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:italic;'></span><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; margin-left:18pt; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-indent:-18pt; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style='font-family:inherit;'>6.<span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'>    </span></span></span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Carian lokasi alternative yang sesuai untuk pemindahan banjir (selain daripada pusat pemindahan yang didaftarkan) sekiranya pusat pemindahan yang disediakan penuh atau sebagainya secara interaktif mengikut radius yang diinputkan. Seperti sekolah, tempat ibadat dan dewan. </span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'></span></span></p><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:italic;'></span><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; margin-left:18pt; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-indent:-18pt; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style=