pt; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style='font-family:inherit;'>9.<span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'>  </span><span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'> </span></span></span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Pengiraan jumlah hotspot secara interaktif berdasarkan paparan skrin. </span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'></span></span></p><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:italic;'></span><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; margin-left:18pt; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-indent:-18pt; text-align:justify;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-style:italic;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'><span style='font-family:inherit;'>10.<span style='font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:7pt; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal;'> </span></span></span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; color:black;'>Analisis insiden yang membolehkan kawasan berisiko diplotkan dan seterusnya semua aset yang berada di dalam lokasi tersebut. </span><span style='font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-seri